IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0025.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FEE0025C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 FW-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MF-AMT             PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK
    DISPLAY "FW-IND=" FW-IND
    DISPLAY "MF-AMT=" MF-AMT
    STOP RUN.
MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER - LIMIT 1875 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF A-TY = 'G'
       OR A-TY = 'P'
       OR M-BL >= 2500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FW-IND
        MOVE 0.00 TO MF-AMT
    ELSE
        MOVE 7.50 TO MF-AMT
    END-IF.
